<title>DENMARK: Danish KommuneKredit ups 4% bond amount.</title>
<headline>Danish KommuneKredit ups 4% bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's KommuneKredit raised an existing four percent bond due 2005 by 35.6 million crowns to 366.85 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou and lead manager Jyske Bank said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the bonds were already sold. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
